    "body": "Part of the intent of the spec was to avoid wrong rendering of images accidental EXIF data by using that \"equality\" as a checksum of sorts.\nHowever, I think that changing the spec to allow equality with an epsilon and fixing the webkit implementation makes total sense.\n\nIf you wanted to file a spec PR and do the necessary work like create new WPTs and file implementation bugs, I'd be happy to help it along.",
